      "header": "method Maximum(s: seq<int>) returns (m: int)\n  requires |s| > 0\n  ensures forall k :: 0 <= k < |s| ==> s[k] <= m\n  ensures exists k :: 0 <= k < |s| && m == s[k]"
    }
  ],
  "reference": {
    "Maximum": "m := s[0];\nvar i := 1;\nwhile i < |s|\n  invariant 1 <= i <= |s|\n  invariant forall k :: 0 <= k < i ==> s[k] <= m\n  invariant exists k :: 0 <= k < i && m == s[k]\n  decreases |s| - i\n{\n  if s[i] > m {\n    m := s[i];\n  }\n  i := i + 1;\n}"
  },
